    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43504" root="&#xA;                        مثل&#xA;                    " body-key="m1">
                        
                            6
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمَاثَلَ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He became nearly in a sound,</i> or
<i>healthy, state;</i> or <i>near to convalescence:</i> (K:)
or <i>he became more like the sound,</i> or <i>healthy,
than the unsound,</i> or <i>unhealthy, who is suffering
from a chronic and pervading disease;</i> (TA;)
or so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تماثل لِلْبُرْءِ</span>. (M.) Said also of a wound:
(T, S in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دمل</span>:) and of a disease; like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَشْكَلَ</span>.
(TA, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شكل</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمَاثَلَا</span>
                        <i>i. q.</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَشَابَهَا</span>. (M, K in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سوى</span>.)

